.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, r2SCAN-3c with CPCM (water), optimisation and frequencies of Na+(H2O)6, started from the gas-phase geometry and Hessian of the step before. This calculation shows the arrangement with four waters in the first shell and two beyond them in water, where the order of the arrangements differs from the gas phase.
